{"c":[{"id":"1642b5380f13f0bc","sum":"Undo: whole-field only. Ask: Jev ask.scope per field; stand-ins need answeringScope. Settled fields fill; <=8 unclear use sure, else unsure; no ambiguity/length refusal. AX closed selects show selection only; realfill keeps options, no legends/headings except radio groups.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"177848396eca6f4e","sum":"Helper undo covers whole-field replacements, not host/extension caret/selection/append insertions. Every Ask first asks Jev ask.scope per field; test stand-ins need answeringScope from helper/test/builders.ts or Asks refuse/ask back.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261007T132116Z-e94ee4791db7e513","text":"The helper executor replaces whole fields; caret/selection/append insertion runs in the host or extension and never enters the executor undo ledger.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261007T144012Z-e2952279328219e3","text":"Every Ask route asks Jev's per-field scope question (purpose ask.scope) first, so a test Jev stand-in must answer it: wrap it with answeringScope in helper/test/builders.ts, or Asks refuse or ask back.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"0ec40e0d5ae540d2","sum":"Ask fills settled fields; <=8 unclear fields use sure, else unsure; no refusal for ambiguity/length. Chrome AX closed selects expose only the selection. realfill page walks keep options but no legends/headings except radio groups.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261007T144012Z-ef6cc9d6c94c61fb","text":"I3 ruling: an Ask never refuses for unclear fields or a too-long question; Jev's settled fields fill, unclear ones are asked beside them (AskIntent.sure) only when <= 8, else listed as left to the user (AskIntent.unsure).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261007T162248Z-4dec6eda4a1a65ff","text":"Chrome AX shows a closed select's selected option only, so realfill-asks' default reader desk has no menu options; --form-window page uses the page walks (helper/fixtures/recorded/realfill-pages), which keep no fieldset legend or heading except a radio group's.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"b616cda88a55aeb3","sum":"formInputs synthesizes editable web comboboxes; a secret opener takes the whole next line; clauses respect quotes, literals from retained spans. realfill-asks defaults to page (reader for pre-V4). SC1 requests carry a Disclosure; tests wrap in test/minted.ts.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"f2b260f724b03eed","sum":"Form reading and redaction: formInputs synthesizes editable web comboboxes (formControls alone is incomplete); a secret opener takes the whole next line; instruction clauses respect quotes and model literals come from separate retained spans.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261007T164500Z-f23002306114cfa8","text":"Editable web comboboxes are synthesized by formInputs; formControls alone is not a complete inventory for retaining fill inputs.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261007T173911Z-5d012ef86eac725c","text":"A secret opener consumes the whole next physical line, including conjunctions in its value. Instruction clauses must respect quotes, and model literals must come from separate retained spans.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"18b4fb1a390dd6dc","sum":"realfill-asks defaults to --form-window page since I4 (reader for pre-V4 compares; slow-eval pins reader). SC1: every Jev/writer request carries a Disclosure the clients verify; test requests wrap in test/minted.ts; structuredClone drops it (clone the body).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261007T183953Z-6f2314940641602e","text":"realfill-asks defaults to --form-window page since I4 (the helper plans browser Asks on the page walk); pass --form-window reader to compare with pre-V4 runs. slow-eval's Ask sets pin reader for their P1 references.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261007T194509Z-1033502c97d598d1","text":"SC1: every Jev/writer request carries a Disclosure (privacy/disclosure.ts) that the clients verify; hand-built test requests wrap in test/minted.ts, and structuredClone of a request loses its Disclosure (clone the body, keep the object).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
